"KDE, Kdenlive, корзина проекта, папка, использование, документация, "
"руководство пользователя, видеоредактор, открытый исходный код, свободное "
"ПО, изучение, простота"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:42
msgid "Folders"
msgstr "Папки"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:44
msgid ""
"Folders help keeping the Project Bin organized, structured, and easy to "
"navigate. Folders can be nested and turned into :doc:`individual bins "
"<project_bin_use_multiple_bins>`."
msgstr ""
"Папки помогают поддерживать порядок в корзине проекта, упорядочивать её "
"структуру и упрощают навигацию. Папки можно вкладывать друг в друга и "
"превращать в :doc:`отдельные корзины <project_bin_use_multiple_bins>`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:53
msgid "Creating folders in the project bin"
msgstr "Создание папок в корзине проекта"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:55
msgid ""
"You create a folder by clicking the |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Create Folder` "
"icon in the project bin toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы создать папку, нажмите значок |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Создать папку` "
"на панели инструментов корзины проекта."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:57
msgid ""
"Alternatively, right-click on empty space in the project bin and select |"
"folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Create Folder`."
msgstr ""
"Или щёлкните правой кнопкой мыши по пустому месту в корзине проекта и "
"выберите |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Создать папку`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:59
msgid ""
"If you want to create a folder below an existing one, select that folder "
"first."
msgstr "Чтобы создать папку внутри существующей, сначала выберите эту папку."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:61
msgid ""
"You can delete a folder by selecting the folder and clicking on the |edit-"
"delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete Folder` icon, or by right-click on the folder "
"and selecting |edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete Folder`."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы удалить папку, выберите её и нажмите значок |edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:"
"`Удалить папку` или щёлкните по папке правой кнопкой мыши и выберите |edit-"
"delete|\\ :guilabel:`Удалить папку`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:66
msgid "Folder Right-Click Menu"
msgstr "Контекстное меню папки"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:67
msgid "Right-click on a folder opens this context menu:"
msgstr ""
"При щелчке правой кнопкой мыши по папке открывается это контекстное меню:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:73
msgid "|open_new_bin|:"
msgstr "|open_new_bin|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:73
msgid "Creates a new bin from the folder"
msgstr "Создаёт новую корзину из папки"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:76
msgid "|target_seq|:"
msgstr "|target_seq|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:76
msgid "Check this if you want this folder to be target for new sequences"
msgstr ""
"Установите этот флажок, чтобы эта папка стала целевой для новых "
"последовательностей"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:79
msgid "|target_audio|:"
msgstr "|target_audio|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:79
msgid "Select this if you want this folder to receive all audio captures"
msgstr ""
"Выберите этот параметр, чтобы все записи звука сохранялись в этой папке"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:84
msgid ":guilabel:`Add Clip`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Добавить клип`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:84
msgid ""
":doc:`Add clip or folder </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/clips>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Добавить клип или папку </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"clips>`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:87
msgid "|create_folder|:"
msgstr "|create_folder|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:87
msgid ""
"Creates a new folder. If nothing has been selected in the bin, a new folder "
"is created at the bin level. If a folder has been selected, a new folder "
"underneath the selected one is created."
msgstr ""
"Создаёт новую папку. Если в корзине ничего не выбрано, папка создаётся на "
"верхнем уровне корзины. Если выбрана папка, новая папка создаётся внутри "
"выбранной."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:90
msgid "|rename|:"
msgstr "|rename|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:90
msgid ""
"Renames the folder. Keyboard shortcut is :kbd:`F2`. You can also just double-"
"click the folder name in the bin"
msgstr ""
"Переименовывает папку. Комбинация клавиш — :kbd:`F2`. Также можно просто "
"дважды щёлкнуть по имени папки в корзине"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:93
msgid "|delete_folder|:"
msgstr "|delete_folder|:"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:93
msgid "Deletes the selected folder."
msgstr "Удаляет выбранную папку."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_bin/project_bin_use_folders.rst:96
msgid ""
"Deleting an empty folder happens immediately without any are-you-sure? "
"dialog. Only if there is content will there be a warning dialog window that "
"you need to confirm or cancel."
msgstr ""
"Пустая папка удаляется сразу, без диалогового окна подтверждения. Окно "
"предупреждения, в котором нужно подтвердить или отменить удаление, "
"появляется, только если в папке есть содержимое."
